{
    "title": "Manticore - Beyond the Charts",
    "kind": "quest",
    "startsWhen": "quest(manticore_board) == 2",
    "variables": [
        {
            "name": "pod",
            "value": "0"
        }
    ],
    "steps": [
        {
            "type": "wait",
            "seconds": 4
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "title": {
                "en": "MANTICORE - ACT V",
                "zh": "蝎尾狮号 - 第五幕"
            },
            "subtitle": {
                "en": "Chapter 18 - Beyond the Charts",
                "zh": "第十八章 - 星图之外"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "dialog",
            "pages": [
                {
                    "speaker": "Khador",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "The yacht's last heading points past the Vortex Core, to a system no chart of Neox shows. I have built a gate key for the old jumpgate at the Remnant Yard. It should hold. Probably.",
                        "zh": "游艇最后的航向指向漩涡核心之外，一个尼奥克斯任何星图上都没有的星系。我给残党船坞那道旧跃迁门做了一把钥匙。应该撑得住。大概吧。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Jalen",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "The name from the core: the Halcyon Board. Shareholders. No fleet of their own, only money, and contracts with anyone who will shoot for it.",
                        "zh": "核心里的名字：哈尔西恩董事会。一群股东。他们自己没有舰队，只有钱，以及和任何肯为钱开枪的人签下的合同。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Hayley Snocom",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Indigo Brink, the Grey Shadow, the Lancers. All of them on one payroll. I want to see the faces that signed it.",
                        "zh": "靛蓝深渊、灰影、枪骑兵。全在同一张工资单上。我想看看签字的都是些什么嘴脸。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Scout first, ace. Find out what they're doing out there before they know we're coming.",
                        "zh": "王牌，先侦察。在他们知道我们要来之前，弄清楚他们在那边干什么。"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "name": "beyond_briefed"
        },
        {
            "type": "questorbit",
            "station": "manticore_neox:exchange"
        },
        {
            "type": "goto",
            "station": "manticore_neox:exchange",
            "dock": false,
            "objective": {
                "en": "Jump through the Remnant Yard's gate to Meridian Reach and fly to the Halcyon Exchange.",
                "zh": "穿过残党船坞的跃迁门前往子午边域，飞往哈尔西恩交易所。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "wait",
            "seconds": 8
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran Exchange Security",
            "text": {
                "en": "Unregistered vessel, you are in a private system. Your arrival has been billed. Payment is collected by our contractors.",
                "zh": "未登记船只，你已进入私人星系。你的到访已被计费。费用将由我们的承包商收取。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "fight",
            "station": "manticore_neox:exchange",
            "quiet": false,
            "name": "Contract Hunter",
            "ships": [
                {
                    "ship": 22,
                    "count": 2,
                    "race": "terran",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                },
                {
                    "ship": 28,
                    "count": 2,
                    "race": "terran",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                }
            ],
            "objective": {
                "en": "Destroy the Board's contract hunters.",
                "zh": "消灭董事会的合同猎手。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran female Jalen",
            "text": {
                "en": "One of them dropped a sealed courier pod. Same codes as the yacht. Hack it.",
                "zh": "其中一个丢下了一个密封的信使舱，和游艇用的是同一套密码。破解它。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "wreck",
            "race": "terran",
            "name": "Courier Pod",
            "at": "-3000 1500 30000"
        },
        {
            "type": "on",
            "trigger": "hacked",
            "steps": [
                {
                    "type": "set",
                    "variable": "pod",
                    "value": "1"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "objective",
            "station": "manticore_neox:exchange",
            "text": {
                "en": "Hack the courier pod.",
                "zh": "破解信使舱。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "waituntil",
            "condition": "pod > 0"
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran female Jalen",
            "text": {
                "en": "It's a production schedule. The Gate Zero Foundry, in this system, is refining Glow. Enough for twelve devices like the one that caused the Shattering.",
                "zh": "这是一份生产计划。本星系的零号门铸造厂正在精炼光晶，够造十二个引发“碎裂”那样的装置。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "Khador",
            "text": {
                "en": "Twelve. They don't want to destroy planets. They want to crack them open. A shattered planet's core is pure Glow. They are mining Neox.",
                "zh": "十二个。他们不是想毁掉行星，是想把它们敲开。破碎行星的核心就是纯光晶。他们在开采尼奥克斯。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "questorbit",
            "station": "manticore_neox:exchange",
            "on": false
        },
        {
            "type": "reward",
            "credits": 30000,
            "title": {
                "en": "Board's plan uncovered",
                "zh": "董事会的计划曝光"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "name": "plan_found"
        },
        {
            "type": "goto",
            "station": "manticore_neox:manticore",
            "dock": true,
            "objective": {
                "en": "Return to the Manticore.",
                "zh": "返回蝎尾狮号。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "dialog",
            "pages": [
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Saya",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "The Shattering wasn't a war crime to them. It was a test drill.",
                        "zh": "对他们来说，“碎裂”不是战争罪行，只是一次试钻。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Then we shut the Foundry down before the first of those twelve leaves it.",
                        "zh": "那我们就赶在那十二个里的第一个出厂之前，关掉铸造厂。"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "complete",
            "reward": 12000,
            "title": {
                "en": "Chapter 18 complete",
                "zh": "第十八章 完成"
            }
        }
    ]
}
